{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act44side_level_act44side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act44side",
  "stageId": "act44side_07",
  "title": "冷月",
  "storyCode": "AT-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "30d62d01dfcd25a327f7262c9754faf7f0d18f226d5d15143d34873ab9615376",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "电视台的所有人全都乱成一团了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶以前跟我讲过，她年轻的时候，真的有北院的渗透部队进入过御机......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听的时候不觉得有什么，可现在看来，我们面前的场面只是小意思，万一......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样？我送给金兵卫的这份大礼怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "效果可能有点......好过头了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是专心想我们自己的事吧。森内老板已经混进了电视台，我们也该趁机到继位仪式现场去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里这时应该没什么人。如果还有抵抗，吉星，你也得搭把手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那现在就只剩开拔了！我来给你们带路！从这个排风口爬上去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们也快上来啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来、来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好高......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别怕，萌萌香，我这里有灯。手给我，我牵着你走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香努力控制自己不要往下看，但她的身体依然止不住地颤抖摇晃。\n此刻，她们在密密麻麻的钢筋结构之间缓缓移动，头顶一片昏暗，脚下亮如白昼。\n电视台的员工、黑道、忍者，乱成一团的人们就在她们正下方来来去去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吉星，你怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还、还好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们不常在这种地方走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁会每天在这种地方跑来跑去啦，你难道是什么叛逃的忍者吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那倒不是。我都是为了躲忍者，才习惯在这种地方走路的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "躲忍者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗐，那不重要——我们到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，下面还有几个人看着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，从这边的空隙跳过去，顺着那边的管道下到舞台上，那边是他们的视线盲区。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么长的距离？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我试试......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香紧握双拳，目光直勾勾地盯着正前方，左脚往后蹬地——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "原本静止的钢筋结构突然开始运转起来，萌萌香脚下的平台也不规则地震动着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么突然就动起来了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我好像要滑下去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心头顶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怎么回事......\n哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掉下去了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管那么多了，更纱，我们也下去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀——嚯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，你怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还好！我还撑得住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，你快上舞台，我去操作台控制线路！灯光一亮你就开始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等不及要听萌萌香开嗓了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可能不太行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪......小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......萌萌香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你来阻止我，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了金石会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我大概知道你会说什么。那会把金石会整个毁掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "监视的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪小姐，急报，星熊已经杀到电视台门口了。按照三船先生的指令，您该往那边去了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊是为了她才出现在这里的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "监视的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可三船先生——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另一个监视我的人，麻烦去告诉三船先生，星熊一定会来，我会在这儿等她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，萌萌香，吉星小姐，还有我不知道名字的，躲在控制台那边的小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我建议你们不要轻举妄动，直到星熊前来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三船先生和金石会的确有许多对不住你们的地方，但这里是我，还有其他一些人的容身之处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能放任你们毁了它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别听她吓唬人！萌萌香——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑色的鬼手忽然出现在吉星脖颈之前，吉星下意识地往后退了一步，扣动扳机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鬼手直接撕开钢珠形状的榴弹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "灯突然关了。整个舞台暗了下来，只有微弱的光从控制面板的方向传来。\n澪一手持短刀，一手持长刀，往有光的方向走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，我在这儿......过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "顶棚上的灯突然亮了一盏，直射澪的眼睛，然后又是一盏，又是一盏，又是一盏——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "又全数同时熄灭。\n但澪的犹豫也只持续了一瞬。她微微定了定神，直扑控制台而去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啪！\n一盏射灯险些砸中澪的头顶，被澪侧身闪开。再看控制台时，那里已经没人了。\n趁澪操作控制台的当口，吉星，萌萌香，更纱，所有人都开始往舞台侧边出入口的方向狂奔而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "门被她锁上了！我们换个门——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咔哒，咔哒，咔哒。\n落锁声在几人周围响了个遍......\n连头顶的灯也重新亮了起来。\n澪缓缓走向下意识地聚成一堆的三人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灯现在不归你们管。不要顽抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......归我管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "更纱紧闭双眼，举起手中似灯非灯的长杖。\n澪的脚步陡然加快。\n就在这时，长杖一端忽然发出明亮如白昼的强光，整个舞台顶部的灯光再度熄灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不只是灯光，整个舞台残存的光全部被困在了杖尖那团跳动着的液体之中——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冰美人，要关灯咯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——而后被吞噬殆尽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更纱？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我睡一会儿......好累......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）这、这下怎么办？我听见澪小姐的脚步声了！她在往我们这边来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）我们先往另一边的舞台出口去吧，万一那边的门没锁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）不行，太远了，她会发现我们的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）我们刚刚落下来的地方不就是这儿吗？能不能原路返回？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）通风口——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "吉星背起更纱刚要迈步，澪的说话声就在舞台中央响起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别白费心思。我听得见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么办？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能豁出去了。我去对付她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "与此同时，她身后忽然传来叩击声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锁了吗？那我就不客气了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "门口的人，让开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一声巨响过后，紧锁的大门带着门外的光豁然洞开。\n下一个瞬间，像是受到了门外透进来的光芒的呼唤一样，一个一个明亮的光球从更纱的杖中缓缓漂浮起来，悠然回到了它们来的地方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......更纱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为会多睡一会儿呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要我还睡着，这里就别想再亮起来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "更纱打了个哈欠，连带着头顶的灯光也跟着忽闪。\n见澪没有动，更纱往控制台的方向走去。\n她已经走了不远的一段，连萌萌香也试探着跟上了她，澪仍然站在原地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去阻止她们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去，你的刀已经出鞘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对付她们，不是我的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就凭在你之后赶来的那些乌合之众，恐怕还过不了吉星和更纱那关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如若真是如此，我也无可奈何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三船呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不关心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们之间的这场战斗，与他无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g13_smallroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察接线员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惟任先生，最后一家电视台的线路也恢复正常了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察接线员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现场指挥问您花火大会怎么办。经过刚才那一吓，市民都有些惊魂未定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会不会有踩踏一类严重事件的风险？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察接线员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很低，和预想情况没有太大差别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就接着办下去。三船喜欢热闹，我们就帮他热闹到底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察接线员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同时还不停有市民打来电话，问刚刚的事情到底是怎么回事，您看......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看？我能怎么看？告诉市民，警察正在调查当中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，关于为什么误播的信号是北院入侵的紧急警报，这一点的责任全在金石电视台，警方会严肃处理——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "值班警察",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惟任先生，有人来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁，三船光平？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惟任先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然不是三船，我还以为会是那位一直对他关爱有加的议员先生亲自来访呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "捕风捉影对您的职业生涯没有好处，而且您未免把自己看得太高了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，这算是承认了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的确是来警告您的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今夜在仁田街发生的混乱，警察方面已经难辞其咎。我们希望这样的混乱不要继续扩大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难辞其咎？我好怕啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "端正态度。您不是没有平安了结此事的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我倒要向您请教请教了，我到底应该怎么办呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中止今晚举办的一切活动，集中警力控制金石电视台，搜捕与事件相关的人员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪几位？我记一下。三船光平肯定是一号嫌疑人吧？他的电视台居然敢随便放那种东西——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的人无权动他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就一切免谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然您不愿服从命令，就在这份辞退通知上签个字，然后就可以走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果对内容有疑虑，请尽管咨询您的上级。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哦，我现在还有回头的余地吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，可不是吗，已经晚了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "说着，刑警伸出脚尖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......把来客轻轻勾倒在地，然后从他手里接过那张签着自己上司大名的纸，缓缓撕成碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为议员大人的秘书会是个硬角色呢，怎么一碰就倒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的访客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你敢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回去告诉你们那个议员，警察保护的是他那条烂命，不是他的烂钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他真觉得有人想要他的命，让他自己来报案，我们会考虑受理的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，给我滚出这间警察局！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白色的长刀，黑色的手套，白色的裸手，黑色的长刀，白色的短刀，黑色的鬼手——\n黑白之间的轮转令人目眩。黎博利挥刀的路数与她给人的印象全然相反，没有回，只有去，没有防守，只有试探和抢攻。\n独角的鬼却朴素得多。闪避、格挡、后退、腾挪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一十二刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚刚一口气挡了我一十二刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么不反击？你仍在害怕你手里的刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那它一开始就不会出鞘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是你，看起来斯斯文文，打起架来凶狠至极。金兵卫的刀可不是这一路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的刀与他无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你为什么替他卖命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我何曾替他卖命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别自欺欺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊缓缓环顾四周。\n吉星的榴弹在各处爆响，而舞台装置几乎成了由更纱使役的巨大怪物。\n再加上四处躲藏的萌萌香，局势不仅撑得下去，甚至还略有余裕。\n如今，当初制定的作战计划就只差最后一环......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要保护的东西，只有金石会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你眼里，只有金兵卫的金石会，才是金石会吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能让为人所不容的渣滓们活下去，这才是金石会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铁斋不能让你活下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再这么挡下去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你终究会露出破绽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你终于出手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也只是割破了你衣服的下摆而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你周身缠绕着蓝色的火焰。那是你的源石技艺吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蓝色的火焰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还真是。我没注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起那个，告诉我，为什么铁斋不能让你活下去，金兵卫却可以？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为铁斋甚至没法保护他自己——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊简简单单地刺出一刀，那刀上缠绕着的火焰却逼得澪向后跃了一大步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不太想听这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你身上的火焰，烧得更旺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我，为什么铁斋不能让你活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为铁斋没法保护他自己。御机不需要他，不需要铁斋手下的澪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个衣衫褴褛还一言不发，只在别人欺负到自己头上时以命相搏的孤儿，是祸害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个盛装见人却沉默寡言，只在公司利益受损时挥刀砍人的助理，是让人憧憬的高岭之花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我先前还以为你是什么家道中落的武家千金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铁斋想给我们这些社会渣滓一个家，所以他死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三船知道我们根本不配有一个家，所以，他活到了今天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是御机对金石会的定论？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一向如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊周身青蓝色的烈火几乎要将她完全包裹其中。\n黎博利忽然觉得，在吞噬自己之前，那火焰会先将眼前的鬼焚尽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你很愤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二十年前，你也这样愤怒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这重要吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三船先生希望你像二十年前一样失去理智。他觉得这样你就会变成人人得而诛之的狂兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道他想这么做，所以，你在压抑自己，就像上次你不愿拔刀出鞘一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在邀请我对愤怒听之任之？完成你主子的任务？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想这样。但如果你真的这么做了，我也并不介意。我只是觉得可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个完美的敌手，却永远不能以完整的姿态站在我的面前，要么压抑，要么失控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但也就这样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接招。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "澪再度对星熊举刀。\n三只手，三把刀。看似杂乱无章的架势，只等在进攻中逼出那个破绽——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这东西......太重了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算电视台里一团乱，把它从金兵卫的房间里偷出来也快要了我这条老命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......接着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "森内晃悠着身子，用力将巨大的般若抛向对峙的二人。\n澪的鬼手先一步抓住了般若的把手，但星熊高高跃起，近乎舞步般转了半个圈，甩开鬼手，将般若的把手握在手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要么压抑，要么失控？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我不会失控的。有般若不会，没般若，也不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "说着，星熊轻轻握了握刀上的绑带。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过般若毕竟也是我的老伙计了，如果刚才你还有三分胜机......现在，你不可能是我的对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怒火。\n刚刚仿佛压缩在星熊周身的怒火瞬间延烧开去，在她的双臂，在她手中的盾和刀上燃烧。\n星熊往前踏出一步，怒火几乎要顺着地面燎到澪衣服的下摆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不会失控，对我而言已经足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊对面，黑色，白色，人手，鬼手，长刀，短刀。\n黎博利并未有半分怯意。她的嘴角甚至勾起一个难以察觉的弧度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有什么没说完的话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对金石会好一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对萌萌香好一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯独对萌萌香，我做不到问心无愧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金兵卫呢？关于他，你就没什么要叮嘱我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他？此时此刻，我们有聊他的必要吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊随意地换了个便于发力的站姿，青色的火在她周围时断时续地烧着。\n盾面上的般若之面瞪大双眼，而那把刀身的乱纹边缘，下一刻就要渗出青色的血泪——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是......般若？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，这就是般若。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的刀配得上你的刀法。被般若卷入，最终也不过是被甩飞了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你尽可以把它们捡回来，我们接着打过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经明白了你的实力究竟如何，再和你对抗，没有任何意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必须早做准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准备什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "善后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为一个没有三船先生的金石会善后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "森内，萌萌香那边怎么样了，准备好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就等你这边打完啦。更纱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解！萌萌香？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香站在舞台中央，聚光灯已经全数打在她身上。\n吉星已经尽量把她附近清空，但她脚边还是不可避免地躺了几个倒地的黑道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我随时可以开始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更纱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金石电视台今晚最重磅的节目，就要开始了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
